    "execute bounded remediation in containerlab",
    "verify target recovery",
    "verify independent control-flow preservation",
    "verify security invariant remains denied",
    "verify family-specific control where applicable",
    "rollback the applied change",
    "verify target fault restoration",
    "verify controls and security invariant after rollback",
    "restore canonical healthy baseline"
